        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Overwrite Memory"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, fear, mental)\n\nijhyeojin alters the memories of a target within 30 feet, insinuating their faceless visage in the place of others. The target must attempt a 34 Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target is frightened 1 and treats no one as an ally for as long as it's frightened.\n- **Failure:** The target is frightened 2 and is confused for as long as it's frightened.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target is frightened 4 and confused for as long as it's frightened. If the target is a joseung saja, they instead realize the fear of being forgotten and become an ijhyeojin."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "two_actions"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
            },
            "id": "7300c242-62a9-4c4b-8205-93c6c0e9748e",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:07.361623"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Swipe Countenance"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(mental, visual)\n\nRequirements: The ijhyeojin's previous action was a successful claw Strike against the target\n\nThe ijhyeojin copies the countenance of the target, imprinting it perfectly onto their own blank face. While only their face changes, creatures must Seek them and succeed at a 34 Will save to distinguish them visually from the original creature. The sahkil keeps the same visage for 24 hours or until they steal another."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
            "action_cost": {
              "value": "one_action"
            },
            "action_attack_bonus": {
              "value": 0
            },
            "action_damage_variants": {
              "value": []
