              "value": "Trigger: The ijhyeojin critically succeeds at a saving throw against a spell\n\nThe ijhyeojin redirects the triggering spell to a new target other than its caster. If the ijhyeojin is wearing that target's face, the new target takes a \u20132 circumstance penalty to this saving throw."
